; variable usage

; f12 - hitdef yaccel
; f13 - proration (formerly dampender)
; f14 - dampender
; f20 - can x velocity
; f21 - can y velocity
; f23 - can air x hitvel
; f24 - can air y hitvel
; 20 - can hit min x
; 21 - can hit min y
; 22 - can hit max x
; 23 - can hit max y
; 24 - can damage
; 25 - HIT?
; 26 - hittime
; 27 - used for airdash :P
; 49 - p2head.pos
; 52 - won a round? (for an Astral Heat)
; 53 - enchance

